{title: Ab Na Jaa}
{artist: Palash Sen Euphoria}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E]aankhen band [B]kar lu jo main,        [A]dekhu bas tum [B]he
[E]khwaabon me hi [B]keh sakta hu,        [A]apna tum [B]he
[A]rehne de, [B]mera ye,        we [C#m]hem pe hi ye [A]kin
na jaa a [B]bhi,        pyaar [C#m]ki ye raat [A]hai
ab na [C#m]jaa [B],        choti [A]si ek baat [E]hai
ab na [B]jaa [B],        [E]tumhi se hai [B]meri neendein
[A]na bhi ho to [B]kya,        [E]tumhi se hai [B]meri baatein
[A]na bhi ho to [B]kya,        [A]kehne de, [B]taaron ko
ka [C#m]haani unka [A]hi,        na ja a [B]bhi
pyaar [C#m]ki ye raat [A]hai,        ab na [C#m]jaa [B]
choti [A]si ek baat [E]hai,        ab na [B]jaa [B]
pal do [C#m]pal ka sath [A]hai,        ab na [C#m]jaa [B]
jaadu [A]si ye raat [E]hai,        ab na [B]jaa [B]
ab na [B]jaa,        [E]aankhen de pyaar ki [B]boondein
bikhre [A]se kahi sa [A]waal,        [E]aankhon me kitne [B]mausam
pal me [A]bite kitne [B]saal,        [A]kehne de, [B]taaron ko
ka [C#m]haani unka [A]hi,        na ja a [B]bhi
pyaar [C#m]ki ye raat [A]hai,        ab na [C#m]jaa [B]
choti [A]si ek baat [E]hai,        ab na [B]jaa ? [B]
pal do [C#m]pal ka sath [A]hai,        ab na [C#m]jaa [B]
